item.description:
We are so honoured to be amongst the finalists for Album of the Year & Best Group at the @aotearoamusicawards. 

‘Ceremony’ was a really beautiful time making music together, & I want to pay tribute to the band for putting their all into it - Cass, Basil, Alex Freer and Tom Healy. 
Tom is also up for Best Producer for ‘Ceremony’ & Best Engineer for @marlonwilliamssings ‘My Boy’. 
Awards are weird but we are really proud of this, alongside the Taite Prize nom too, so thank you, it means a lot. 

Massive mihi also to everyone who helped us record, release and tour ‘Ceremony’ ~

